# Posters copied into the site are binary; never convert line endings.
*.webp binary

# Text deliverables and the code that seals or validates them are committed
# with LF and checked out with LF on every OS, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Sealed review digests (seal-editorial-review.mjs) hash the working copy;
# push-candidate and the publisher compare them with the committed blobs.
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
